abstract: >
  An open-source Nextflow DSL2 pipeline for whole-genome analysis of
  Streptococcus agalactiae, including QC, assembly, annotation, AMR
  detection, virulence profiling, MLST, core genome phylogeny, and
  publication-quality visualization.
